        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Lunavoid is a psychological linear horror game. Play through three different scenarios, each with its own unique graphic style and gameplay. There seems to be something wrong with the moon, and the world is under global lockdown. Will you figure out what's happening, or will you remain isolated, never finding out?</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >SCENARIOS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play through 3 different scenarios each with its own gameplay and graphic style. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >REALISM</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This scenario plays slow and tries to be more realistic with the movement.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3883560/extras/d19ccf5c6a84446ece9ac5f00b88ad80.poster.avif?t=1758092910\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3883560/extras/d19ccf5c6a84446ece9ac5f00b88ad80.webm?t=1758092910\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3883560/extras/d19ccf5c6a84446ece9ac5f00b88ad80.mp4?t=1758092910\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >RETRO</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Retro shows off more of a pixel and old school look with a locked aspect ratio. Gameplay also moves faster and is more responsive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3883560/extras/e1aa52562e819373734702bf3d60dc53.poster.avif?t=1758092910\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3883560/extras/e1aa52562e819373734702bf3d60dc53.webm?t=1758092910\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3883560/extras/e1aa52562e819373734702bf3d60dc53.mp4?t=1758092910\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >POINT AND CLICK</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With no movement you must look around and interact with your mouse while stuck in one place.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3883560/extras/9dc2aeece05d442080a0de5e622c8f87.poster.avif?t=1758092910\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3883560/extras/9dc2aeece05d442080a0de5e622c8f87.webm?t=1758092910\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3883560/extras/9dc2aeece05d442080a0de5e622c8f87.mp4?t=1758092910\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >PLAYTIME</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Est 45 - 60 minutes</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >ROADMAP</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fix any game breaking bugs that occur</p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Lunavoid is a psychological linear horror game. Play through three different scenarios, each with its own unique graphic style and gameplay. There seems to be something wrong with the moon, and the world is under global lockdown. Will you figure out what's happening, or will you remain isolated, never finding out?</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >SCENARIOS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play through 3 different scenarios each with its own gameplay and graphic style. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >REALISM</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This scenario plays slow and tries to be more realistic with the movement.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3883560/extras/d19ccf5c6a84446ece9ac5f00b88ad80.poster.avif?t=1758092910\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3883560/extras/d19ccf5c6a84446ece9ac5f00b88ad80.webm?t=1758092910\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3883560/extras/d19ccf5c6a84446ece9ac5f00b88ad80.mp4?t=1758092910\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >RETRO</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Retro shows off more of a pixel and old school look with a locked aspect ratio. Gameplay also moves faster and is more responsive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3883560/extras/e1aa52562e819373734702bf3d60dc53.poster.avif?t=1758092910\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3883560/extras/e1aa52562e819373734702bf3d60dc53.webm?t=1758092910\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3883560/extras/e1aa52562e819373734702bf3d60dc53.mp4?t=1758092910\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >POINT AND CLICK</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With no movement you must look around and interact with your mouse while stuck in one place.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3883560/extras/9dc2aeece05d442080a0de5e622c8f87.poster.avif?t=1758092910\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3883560/extras/9dc2aeece05d442080a0de5e622c8f87.webm?t=1758092910\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3883560/extras/9dc2aeece05d442080a0de5e622c8f87.mp4?t=1758092910\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >PLAYTIME</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Est 45 - 60 minutes</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >ROADMAP</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fix any game breaking bugs that occur</p>",
